CoEviRAG release

This distribution contains the CoEviRAG implementation and modified upstream utilities.
The release uses the coevirag package and CoEviRAG main class; network
parameter names and state-dict layouts are unchanged.
The source distribution supplies the Apache License, Version 2.0, reproduced
unchanged in LICENSE.txt. This notice does not assign new ownership to upstream
work or license third-party datasets, model weights, or hosted services.

The upstream README credits graph-construction methods to HippoRAG:
https://github.com/OSU-NLP-Group/HippoRAG
Retained graph, storage, prompt, embedding, and API utilities preserve that
attribution.

Modified Python files carry CoEviRAG release notices. The distribution removes
standalone repair generation/verification, alternative backends, baseline
programs, and exploratory runners; shared compatibility helpers are documented
in docs/REPRODUCIBILITY.md. No upstream copyright notice has been intentionally removed.
